<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR" data-theme="{{ theme }}" class="h-full bg-industrial-50">
<head>
  <meta name="referrer" content="strict-origin-when-cross-origin">
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>500 - Erro do Servidor - Tavolo</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  @vite(['resources/css/app.css'])
</head>
<body class="h-full font-sans text-industrial-900">
  <div class="min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-md w-full text-center">
      <!-- Icon -->
      <div class="mb-6">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-red-500/10">
          <i class="fas fa-server text-red-600 text-4xl"></i>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Error Code -->
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2">{{ error.code }}</h1>
      
      <!-- Error Title -->
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-industrial-900 mb-4">
        Erro do Servidor
      </h2>

      <!-- Error Message -->
      <p class="app-muted mb-8">
        Desculpe, ocorreu um erro inesperado no servidor. Nossa equipe foi notificada e está trabalhando para resolver o problema.
      </p>

      <!-- Action Buttons -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-accent-600 text-white font-medium hover:bg-accent-700 transition">
          <i class="fas fa-home mr-2"></i>
          Voltar ao Início
        </a>
        <a href="/dashboard" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-industrial-200 text-industrial-900 font-medium hover:bg-industrial-300 transition">
          <i class="fas fa-gauge mr-2"></i>
          Dashboard
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Additional Info -->
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-industrial-200">
        <p class="text-sm text-industrial-500">
          Código do Erro: {{ error.code }} | <a href="/" class="text-accent-600 hover:text-accent-700 font-medium">Suporte</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Font Awesome -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</body>
</html>
